<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id">Daniel</book>
  <para style="h">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Daniel</para>
  <para style="mt">Daniel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehoiakim ih Judah siangpahrang a ṭuan kum thumnak ah Babilon siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in Jerusalem khawpi cu a do ih a kulh ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in siangpahrang Jehoiakim cu a kaihter ih Biakinn thilri le hlawnthil hrekkhat pawl a lakter. A kaihmi pawl cu Babilon ah a fehpi ih Biakinn thilri a lakmi pawl cu a khawzing pawl ih biakinn thilri retnak khaan ah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in a kuthnuai ih bawi tum bik pakhat Ashpenaz kha ralkaihmi le thawngthlakmi Israel mi pawl sungin siangpahrang hrin le bawi phun, mino deuh pawl hril dingah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi piangzet, mifim, ziangkim ah zirnak a nei ciami, fimvarmi le kutke himmi an si pei ih siangpahrang inn ah hnaṭuan theitu an si pei, tiah a ti. Babilon ṭong an siar thiam le an ngan thiamnak dingah Ashpenaz cu anmah zirhtu a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nitinte an ei an inmi cu siangpahrang inn ih ei le inmi rawl le zu a si ve pei. Cutiih kum thum zirnak an neih hnuah siangpahrang hmaiah an suak pei, tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutiih hrilmi lakah cun Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael le Azariah an tel ve. An pali in Judah hrin ihsin an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An bawi upabik cun annih cu hmin thar a sak hai ih an hminthar cu Belteshazzar, Shadrak, Meshak le Abednego ti an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Daniel cun siangpahrang inn ih rawl ei tahrat in le zu in tahrat in raithiang lomi si lo ding ah a thinlung a ṭhencat aw; curuangah Ashpenaz cu amah bawm dingin zaangfah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ashpenaz khal cu Pathian in Daniel parah zaangfahnak thinlung a neihter;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />sikhalsehla Aspenaz in siangpahrang a ṭih ruangah Daniel hnenah cun, “Nan ei ding le nan in dingmi hi siangpahrang amah rori ih relcat ciami a si. Curuangah tlangval dang vekin nan cakvak lo a si pang ahcun keimah lehlam in that men ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Daniel cu amah le a rualpi pathum zohtu dingah Ashpenaz in mikiltu ah a retmi pa hnenah a feh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ni hra sung in hniksak aw. Ei dingah hanghnah hangrah le in dingah tidai in pe hnik aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule tlangval dang siangpahrang inn ih ti le rawl a ei a intu pawl thawn in ṭhim hnik awla cuih par ihsin thu cu ṭhencat sal leh aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anmah kiltupa cu nihra sung hniksak dingah a lung a kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nihra cu a hung kim ih an zoh tikah siangpahrang inn ih ti le rawl a eitu pawl hnakin harhdam sawn le cak sawn in an lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Curuangah cuih ni thokin anmah kiltupa cun siangpahrang ih pekmi rawl si loin hanghnah hangrah cu a eiter lanta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian in hi tlangval pali cu fimnak, calai lam thiamnak le theihthiamnak a pek. Cuih tlunah Pathian in Daniel cu mang lehtheinak le langnak pawl simfiang theinak a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siangpahrang in tikcu a khiahmi kum thum a kim tikah Ashpenaz in tlangval pawl cu Nebuchadnezzar hnenah a fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Siangpahrang thawn thu an ruah aw ih midang hmuahhmuah hnakin Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael le Azariah pawl in a lung an tong bik. Curuangah siangpahrang inn ih hnaṭuantu ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siangpahrang in ziangvek thu a suh ih, ziangvek thuharsa a suahter hmanah hi tlangval pali cun a ram ukmi sungih kutṭial zohthiam le mitkher thiam pawl hnakin a lethra in an thei thei deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Persia siangpahrang Sairas in Babilon a neh tiang Daniel cu siangpahrang hnaṭuantu ah a um lanta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar cu siangpahrang a ṭuan kum hnihnak ah mang pakhat a man. Cuih a mang cun a thin a harter tukih a it thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Curuangah a kutṭial zohthiam pawl, a mitkher thiam pawl, dawithiam pawl le arsi zohthiam pawl kha a mang lettu dingah a ko hai. A hnenah an ra ih a hmaiih an ra din tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />an hnenah cun, “Mang ka manmi in ka thin i harter tuk. A tican theih ka duh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siangpahrang hnenah Aram ṭong in, “Maw siangpahrang bawipa, na nunkhua sau hram seh. Na mang cu in sim awla a tican kan lo sim pei cu,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siangpahrang in an hnenah, “Ka mang le a tican in sim dingah ka tummi le ka ruahcat zomi a si. In sim thei lo asile nan kut le nan ke ka lo bohthlek thluh ding ih nan inn pawl khal hnawmpen ah ka cangter thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka mang le a tican in sim thei a si ahcun laksawng le hminṭhatnak ka lo pe ding. Curuangah atu-ah ka mang le a tican cu i sim uh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siangpahrang hnenah cun, “Siangpahrang Bawipa in na mang in sim a si ahcun a tican cu kan lo sim ding,” an ti sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah siangpahrang in aw-hrangzet in, “Ka ruah vek ngaingai nan sihi! A tikcu reideuh seh ti hi nan tummi a si, ziangahtile ka mang in sim thei lo ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />nan zatein hremnak bangrep ka lo pe ding, tiih ka ruahcat zomi nan theih ruangah a si. Tikcu a reideuh asile thu cu a thleng-aw deuh ding tiih ruahsannak nan neih ruangah nan lakah theihthiam awknak nan nei ih thuphan lawnglawng in sim rero a si ko. Ka mang cu ziang a si ti in sim uh. Cule ka mangih tican khal in sim thei, ti ka thei ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siangpahrang ih thuronmi pawl in, “Hi leilung tlunah hin siangpahrang bawipa nangmah ih theih na duhmi hi a lo sim theitu zohman an um lo ding. Na thusuhmi vek hi ziangvek siangpahrang tum bik le cak bik hman in an kutṭial zohthiam, an mitkher thiam le an dawithiam pawl hnenah an sut dah keel lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Siangpahrang bawipa na thusuhmi hi a hartuk lawmmam ih khawzing pawl dah tilo milai cun na hrangah a let theitu zohman an um lo ding. Khawzing pawl le milai lakah an um fawn lo,” tiah an sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuvete in siangpahrang bawipa cu a thin a heng, a ai a thok ih Babilon ramsungih siangpahrang ruahnak petu pawl hmuahhmuah that ṭheh dingah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuticun siangpahrang ruahnak petu pawl hmuahhmuah Daniel le a rualpi pawl tiangin thah dingah thu pek ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule Daniel cu mi-thattu dingih ṭuanvo pekmi, siangpahrang kiltu ralkap pawl hotu ralbawi Ariok hnenah a feh. Ralring zetin a ṭong ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ariok cu, “Ziangah so siangpahrang bawipa in hibangtuk thupek hrangzet cu a suah?” tiah a sut. Cutikah Ariok in Daniel cu thil umdaan hmuahhmuah a sim thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hmakhatte-ah Daniel cu siangpahrang hnenah a feh ih a mang ih tican a sim theinak dingah tikcu reideuh a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Daniel cu a tlung ih a rualpi Hananiah, Mishael le Azariah pawl cu cuih thuhla pawl a sim ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Babilon ramsung siangpahrang ruahnak petu pawl thawn thahcih an si lonak dingah le cuih mangbangza thil an hnenih a fiangter theinak dingin, Pathian hnenih zaangfahnak dil dingah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule cuih zan rori ah Daniel cun langnak a hmu ih cuih mangbangza thil cu a hnenah fianter a si. Cule Daniel in vancung Pathian cu a thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Pathian cu a fim ih huham a nei, Kumkhua in amah cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah in tikcu le caan hi a tuah; Siangpahrang pawl a din hai ih Amah in a ṭhumsal hai a si. Fimnak le theihthiamnak a petu cu Amah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuthuk le thuthup khal Amah in a langter ṭheh. Khawthim lakih thuhmi khal Amah in a thei thluh. Amah cu tleunak in a kulh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Maw ka pu le ka pa ih Pathian, Nangmah cu ka lo thangṭhat ih ka lo upat a si. Nangmah in fimnak le cahnak i pek. Ka thlacamnak i ngai ih Siangpahrang hnenih sim ding tla i sim zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Daniel cu siangpahrang ruahnak petu pawl that ding ih ṭuanvo pekmi Ariok hnenah a feh ih, “That hlah aw, siangpahrang hnenah i fehpi awla a mangih tican cu ka sim ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hmakhatte-ah Ariok in Daniel cu siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar hnenah a fehpi ih, “Siangpahrang bawipa, Judah saltangmi lakah na mang let theitu ding pakhat ka tong zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Siangpahrang in (Belteshazzar ti tla ih an kawhmi) Daniel hnenah cun, “Ziang mang ka man timi le a tican i sim thei pei maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Daniel in, “Maw siangpahrang bawipa, na mang le a tican a lo sim theitu zohman an um lo; mifim pawl siseh, mitkher thiam siseh, kutṭial zohthiam le arsi zohthiam siseh, zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sikhalsehla vancung ah, mangbangza thil a simfiang theitu Pathian a um. Amah in siangpahrang bawipa, na hnenah hmailam ih a cang dingmi thu a lo sim cia a si. Na ihthah lai ih na hmuhmi na mang cu ka lo sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Siangpahrang bawipa, na ihthah laiah hmailam thu na man. Cule mangbangza a langfiangtertu Pathian in hmailam ih a rathleng dingmi thil kha a lo hmuh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hi thil cu ka hnenah a simfiangmi a si; keimah hi midang hnakih ka fimbik ruangah a si lo, asinain siangpahrang bawipa nangmah in na mangih tican cu na theih theinak dingah le na hnenih a ra thlengmi ruahnak pawl hi na theihnak dingah hiti in simfiang a sinak cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Maw siangpahrang bawipa, na mangah a tum le a maksak zetmi, a vaar zetmi le a tleu zetmi, asinain zoh tikah ṭihnungza a si mi milem na hmai ih a din kha na hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A lu cu sui hlirih tuahmi, a ṭaang le a kut cu ngun in tuahmi, a taai le a cawn cu dar ih tuahmi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />a ke pawl cu thir ih tuahmi an si ih a ke zaphak cu thir a hrek, tlak a hrek ih tuahmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cuih milem cu na zoh rero laifang ah zohmanih tham loin lungpi pakhat cu amahte in a ril ih thir le tlak ih tuahmi a ke cu a rilh ngah ih a parh ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hmakhatte-ah thir le tlak, dar le ngun le sui pawl cu an kuaizaam ih ṭhal ih fangrialnak hmunih leivut bangtuk ah an cang ṭheh. Cuih leivut pawl cu thli in a neh malte hman um lo tiangin a semhlo ṭheh. Asinain cuih lungto cu a ṭhang vivo ih tlang tumpi ah a cang; cule leilung pumpi a khuh ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Na mang cu cumi a si. Maw siangpahrang bawipa, na mangih tican cu atu-ah ka lo sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Siangpahrang bawipa, nang hi siangpahrang hmuahhmuah lakah a tumbik le a maksakbik na si. Vancung Pathian in siangpahrang lakih lal bik ah a lo tuah ih huham le cahnak le hminthannak tla a lo pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Milai umnak leitlun hmuahhmuah uktu ah a lo tuah ih ramsa le vate tlun khalah uktu ah a lo tuah. Nangmah hi a lu ih sui kha na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na hnuah ram uknak a um hrih ding naón nangmah ih ram uknak tluk cun a nasa lo ding. Cuih hnuah ram uknak pathumnak a um ding ih leilung pumpi a uk ding. Cumi cu dar ram uknak a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cuih hnuah ram uknak palinak a um ding ih thir tlukih a cakmi a si ding. Cutiih a cah ruangah ziang hmuahhmuah a deengkuai ding ih a khiak ṭheh ding. Thir cun ziang hmuahhmuah a denkuai vekin cuih hlanih uknak hmuahhmuah cu a deengkuai ding ih a rialdip ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cule na mangih na hmuh vekin a ke le a kezung pawl cu a hrek thir, a hrek tlak an si. Atican cu cuih uknak cu a ṭhen awmi uknak a si ding tinak a si. Thir vekih cahnak a nei ve ding, ziangahtile thir le tlak an rawi-awk ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A kezung pawl cu a hrek thir, a hrek tlak an si ih a tican cu cuih uknak cu a hrek a cak ding ih a hrek cu a ṭawnṭai ding tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Na hmuh vekin thir cu tlak thawn an rawi aw a si. A sullam cu cuih ram uknak ih uktu bawi pawl in hrinkhat le hrinkhat kom awknak ah hrin dangdang ṭhit ton awknak tuah an tum ding tinak a si. Sikhalsehla an tuahsuak thei lo ding, ziangahtile thir le tlak cu an rawi-aw thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Cuih ram uk bawi pawl ih ram an uk tikah vancung ih Pathian in a cem dah lomi uknak a run umter ding. Zohman in cuih uknak cu an neh lo ding; asinain uknak dang hmuahhmuah cu a siatsuah ṭheh ding ih kumkhua in a hmunta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Na mangah zohman ih tham loin tlang ih lungpi cu amahte in a ril ih thir, dar, tlak, ngun le sui ih tuahmi milem a sut kha na hmu. A maksak mi Pathian in hmailam ih a ra dingmi thil kha siangpahrang bawipa nangmah a lo sim a si. Na mang manmi cekci ka lo sim zo; cule a tican khal dikzet in ka lo simfiang zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Cule siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar cu leilung ah a bok ih Daniel hnenah thawinak le thil hlanmi pawl pek dingin thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Siangpahrang cun, “Na Pathian hi Pathian dang hmuahhmuah lakah a maksak bik a si; siangpahrang tlunah Bawi a si ih mangbangza thil simfiangtu Pathian a si. Himi cu ka thei, ziangahtile mangbangza thil nangmah in na simfiang zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Cule Daniel cu hnaṭuan tumzet a pek ih laksawng mankhung zetzet a pek hnuah Babilon peng hotu bikah a tuah; siangpahrang thuronmi pawl lakah hotubik ah a tuah fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Daniel ih dilsaknak thawngin Shadrak, Meshak le Abednego khal cu Babilon peng thuhla tawlreltu ah siangpahrang in a tuah. Daniel cu siangpahrang inn ih hnaṭuantu ah a um lanta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in, a tung pi sawmkua a vaang pi kua a si mi milem tumpi kha sui in a tuah ih Babilon peng Dura hmunrawn ah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule siangpahrang in a kuthnuai ih bawi upa hmuahhmuah - ramṭhen uktu bawi pawl, ram uk bawi pawl, ram uktu bawi bawmtu pawl, mangki bawi pawl, tangka kaitu pawl, thuṭhentu pawl le bawi dangdang pawl hmun khatah rasuak dingin thu a pe. Siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in sui milem a tuahmi apnak ih rasuak thluh ding an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawi hmuahhmuah cu sui milem apnak hmunah an ra suak ih sui milem hmai ih an din tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />thuthantu pakhat in aw ringzet in, “Phunkip le hnamkip le ṭongkip hmangtu minung pawl, ngaihnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tawtawrawt an tum nan thei ding ih cuvete in hmun khatah phirivau, lemlawi, baza, ṭingṭang le a awn theimi hmuahhmuah an tum tla nan thei ding. Cutiih awnmawi an tum vete in nan lu nan kun pei ih siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar ih a tuahmi sui milem hi nan bia pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lu a kun lotu le a bia lotu cu hmakhatte ah meisa alh sungah thlak an si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah tummi aw an theih vete in phunkip, hnamkip le ṭongkip a hmangtu pawl cu an lu an kun ih siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar ih sui milem cu an bia ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuih caan ah Babilon mi pawl in Judah mi pawl thangsiat dingah tikcu rem cang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Annih in siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar hnenah, “Maw siangpahrang bawipa, na nunkhua sau hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa nangmah in thu na pek ih awnmawi an tum vete in zokhal an lu an kun ding ih sui milem an bia ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lu a kun lotu le sui milem a bia lotu cu meisa alh sungah thlak an si ding, tiah na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babilon peng uktu le hotu dingih ṭuanvo na pekmi Judah mi Shadrak, Meshak le Abednego tla cu siangpahrang bawipa na thupekmi an el. Na Pathian an bia lo, milem na tuahmi hmai khalah an kun lo a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah siangpahrang bawipa cu a thin a heng ngaingai ih cuih pathumte cu a hmai ih rak hruai dingah thu a pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An rat tikah,” Shadrak, Meshak le Abednego, ka khawzing an bia duh lo ih ka sui milem tuahmi hmai khalah an kun duh lo, tiah an lo timi hi thungai a si maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Atu-ah tawtawrawt, phirivau, lemlawi, ṭingṭang le a awn theimi hmuahhmuah an tum ding ih cumi nan theih vete in nan lu nan kun pei ih milem hi nan bia ding. Nan biak duh lo a si ahcun hmakhatte ah meisa alh sungah hlon nan si ding. A lo hum theitu ding Pathian a um tiah nan zum maw si?” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah Shadrak, Meshak le Abednego cun, “Maw siangpahrang bawipa, hi thu ahcun kanmah le kanmah ṭan-awk ṭul in kan ruat lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Meisa alh sungin in hum theitu Pathian a um a si ahcun kan biakmi le kan rianmi kan Pathian lawnglawng a si ih amah cun na cahnak huham sung khal in in hum ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In hum lo a va si hmanah, siangpahrang bawipa, na khawzing pawl cu kan bia lo ding ih na sui milem tuahmi hmai khalah kan kun lo ding, ti cu in theihsak cia aw,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutiih an ṭongmi cu Nebuchadnezzar in a theih tikah a thin a suup thei nawn lo, Shadrak, Meshak, le Abednego parih a thinheng tukah a mithmai a sen ṭheh. A minung pawl cu thu a pek ih meipi an muah ṭheumi hnakih letsarih sa dingin a muahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule a ralkap sungah micak bikbik a hril ih cuih Judah mi pathum kutke ṭem dingah le meisa sungih paih dingah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cute pathum cu an angki, an bawngbi le an lukhuh, an hruhlaimi thilthuam famkim thawn an ṭeem ih meipi sungah cun an paih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Siangpahrang in meipi cu sa cuang dingah thu khohzet ih a pek vekin meipi an muahmi cu a sa ngaingai ih mi pathum meipi sungih a paihtu ralkap cakzet pawl hman cu meisa in a kaang that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cule Shadrak, Meshak le Abednego pawl cu an kutke ṭemmi thawn meipi sungah cun an vung tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule rinlopi-ah Nebuchadnezzar cu a mangbang in a ding lohli! A kuthnuai ih bawi pawl cu, “Mi pathum kha an kutke ṭem tahratin meipi sungah kan paih a si lo maw?” tiah a sut. Annih in, “A si bawipa, na tivek cun a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Siangpahrang bawipa cun, “Ziangtin so meisa sungah mi pali an feh rero ka hmuh hi!” tiah a sut. “An kutke khal ṭemmi an si lo ih a na an tuarnak zianghman a lang fawn lo; cule a palinak tla cu khawzing pawl ih fapa a bang!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar cu meipi tihnak lamih a ummi kotka lamah a feh ih, “Shadrak! Meshak! Abednego! Ziangkimtithei Pathian ih siahhlawh pawl, ra suak uh!” tiah a ko ciamco. Cule hmakhatte ah an rasuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule ram uk bawi pawl, ramṭhen uktu pawl, ramṭhen uktu bawmtu pawl le siangpahrang kuthnuai ih bawi hmuahhmuah an ra ih meipi ih a tuahmawh lomi mi pathum cu an ra zoh ciamco. An sam phangkhat hman a kang lo, an hnipuan khal a kang lo ih meisa rim hman an nam lo. Cumi cu an hmu ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah siangpahrang in, “Shadrak, Meshak le Abednego ih Pathian cu thangṭhat si ko seh! Amah a riantu le a rinsantu pawl runsuak dingah a vancungmi a run thlah a si. An biakmi an Pathian siar lo khawzing dang biak le a hmai ih kun hnak cun ka thupekmi an el ih an nunnak tiangin an pe ngam sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Curuangah atu in thu ka lo pe a si: Zovek phun le zovek hnam an si hmanah, ziangbangtuk ṭong a hmangtu an si hmanah Shadrak, Meshak le Abednego ih Pathian upat lonak thawn a ṭongtu an um a si ahcun anmah cu an kut le an ke bauhthlek ṭheh an si pei ih an inn cu hnawmpen ih canter ṭheh an si pei. Hi bangtuk ih mi run theitu khawzing dang khui hmanah a um lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Siangpahrang in Shadrak, Meshak le Abednego cu Babilon peng sungah an hnaṭuan a kaiter a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in phunkip, hnamkip le ṭongkip hnenah a tanglam thu hi a cah: “Nan parah daihnak um ko seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cungnungbik Pathian in ka hnenih a langtermi mangbangza le khawruahhar thil pawl hi rak ruat ciar hnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Pathian ih in hmuhmi mangbangza pawl hi ziangtlukinso a maksak! Khawruahhar a tuahmi hi ziangtlukinso huham a neih! Pathian cu kumkhua in siangpahrang a si ding, sanikhuk in a uk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka inn ah nunnuamzet le neinungzet in ka rak um ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain voikhat cu ka ih laiah ṭihnungza mang ka man ih tuksumza thil ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuih ka mangih tican i simfiangtu dingah Babilon peng sungih siangpahrang thuronmi pawl kokhawm dingah thu ka pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kutṭial zohthiam pawl, pol pawl, mitkher thiam pawl le arsi zohthiam pawl an ra ih ka mang cu ka sim naón a sullam zohman in in simfiang thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Daniel a ra. (Daniel cu ka khawzing hmin suangin Belteshazzar ti tla in kawh a si.) A sungah khawzing thianghlim pawl ih thlarau a um ih a hnenah ka mang cu ka sim. A hnenah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Belteshazzar, kutṭial zohthiam pawl hotu, na sungah khawzing thianghlim pawl ih thlarau a um ih thil mangbangza le thil thuuk na thei thei, ti ka thei. Ka mang cu hihi a si; a tican i sim aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ka ih laiah langnak ka hmu ih leilung pumpi laifangah thingkung tumpi pakhat ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuih thingkung cu a ṭhang deuhdeuh a sang deuhdeuh ih a ziik in van a dai ih leitlun mi hmuahhmuah in an hmu thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hnah pawl cu an mawi ngaingai, a rah a tam ngaingai ih leilung pumpi ei khopin a tam. Ramsa pawl a hneem ah an bok, vate pawl in a hnge ah bu an sak ih a nungmi tinkim in a rah cu an ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Cuih langnak ih thu ka ngaihtuah rero laiah van ihsin felzet le ralring zetih khua a tangmi vancungmi pakhat a rung ṭum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw ringzet in thu a run phuang ih, ‘Zanthing hi hau uhla a hnge pawl tan ṭheh uh. A hnah pawl hleuh thluh uhla a rah pawl ṭhekdarh ṭheh uh. A hnen ihsin ramsa pawl le a hnge ihsin vate pawl dawihlo ṭheh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a sumhmui le a hram cu thir le dar cikcin thawn khit uhla leilung ah taan uh. Cutawkah hrampi lakah cun taanta uh. “‘Atu ihsin himi pa ih parah dai tla-aw sehla ramsa le thingkung le hrampi lakah umseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kum sarih sung milai thinlung keng lo in ramsa thinlung sawn a keng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himi cu a fel ih a ralringzet vancungmi ih thurelcat mi a si. Cuti a si ruangah leilungtlun khuazakip mi in thei hai seh: Cungnungbik Pathian in minung ih ram uknak tlunah thu a nei ih cuih ram uknak cu a duhmi hnenah a pek, leitlun mi nauta bik hnen khalah a pek thei a si, a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Himi hi ka mang cu a si. Atu-ah Belteshazzar, ka mangih tican i sim aw. Ka thuronmi pawl pakhat hman in a tican in sim thei lo; a sinan nang cun na sim thei ding, ziangahtile khawzing thianghlim pawl ih thlarau na sungah a um a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cumi a theih tikah Belteshazzar ti khalih kawhmi Daniel cu a thin a phang ih zianghman a ṭong thei lo. Cutikah siangpahrang in a hnenah, “Belteshazzar, ka mang le a tican in lo phangter hlah seh,” tiah a ti. Belteshazzar cun, “Siangpahrang bawipa, na mang le a tican hi na hrangah si loin na ral pawl ih hrangah sisehla ka va duh so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thingkung a sangzet ih a ziik in van a daimi cu leilungtlun mi hmuahhmuah in an hmu thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A hnah pawl cu an mawizet ih a rah cu leilung pumpuluk ih eikhop dingin a tam. A hnuai ah ramsa pawl an bok ih a hnge ah vate pawl in bu an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Maw siangpahrang bawipa, a sangzetmi le a hngetzetmi thingkung cu nangmah hi na si. Na nasazet ih van na dai; na cahnak huham cu leilung pumpuluk ah a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Siangpahrang bawipa, nangmah in na zoh laiah van ihsin vancungmi a rung ṭum ih, ‘Thingkung hi hau uhla cekkuai ṭheh uh; a sinan a sumhmui cu leilung ah taanta uh. Thir le dar cikcin in khit uhla hramlakih hrampi lakah cun taanta uh. Hi pa parah dai tla-aw sehla cutawkah ramsa thawn kum sarih sung um hai seh,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Maw siangpahrang bawipa, na mangih tican cu hiti in a si ih Cungnungbik Pathian in na parih a rathleng dingmi cu a phuang zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Minung umnak khua le ram ihsin dawihlo na si ding ih ramsa lakah na um ding. Kum sarih sung cawcang bangin hrampi na ei ding; hramlakah na it ding ih dai in a lo tlak ding. Cule minung ram uknak tlunah Cungnungbik Pathian in thu a nei timi le cuih ram uknak cu a duhmi hnenah a pek timi hi na thei ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sumhmui cu leilung ih taanta dingah vancungmi in thu a pek. A tican cu Pathian in leilung pumpi a uk a si, ti na theih ngah tikah siangpahrang na cangsal ding, tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Curuangah siangpahrang bawipa, thu ka lo simmi hi ngai aw. Sualnak tuah nawn hlah, a dikmi tuah awla mifarah pawl zaangfah aw. Cuticun na ṭhangso vivo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A tivek cun siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar parah a kim ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thla hleihnih hnuah, Babilon khua a siangpahrang inn parih a toihvah rero laiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Zohhnik uh, Babilon a maksakzia hi! Ka khawpi ah ka tuah ih ka huham le ka cahnak, ka sunlawinak le ka maksaknak langter dingah ka din a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A ṭongmi hman a ṭong thluh man hlanah van ihsin aw in, “Siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar, ka simmi hi ngai aw! Na siangpahrang huham cu na hnenih sin lakhlo a si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Minung umnak khua le ram ihsin dawihlo na si ding; hramlak ramsa lakah na um ding ih kum sarih sung cawcang bangin hrampi na ei ding. Cule Cungnungbik Pathian in minung ram uknak tlunah thu a nei ih cuih ram uknak cu amah ih duhmi hnenah a pe thei, tihi na thei ngah ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A tivek cun a kim ngaingai. Nebuchadnezzar cu minung umnak khua le ram ihsin dawihlo a si ih cawcang vekin hrampi a ei ngaingai. A taksa parah dai a tla; a sam cu muvanlai thlahmul tlukin a sau ih a tin cu vate tin vekin a hriam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Kum sarih a kim tikah van khi ka hun zoh ih ka thinlung a kim sal. Cungnungbik Pathian cu ka thangṭhat ih kumkhua ih a nungmi hnenah cun upatnak le sunlawinak ka pek a si,” tiah siangpahrang cun a ti. “Kumkhua in a uk ding, A uknak cu kumkhua in a hmun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Leitlun minung pawl cu zianghmanlo ah a zoh hai. Van ih vancungmi le leitlun ih minung pawl cu, Amah in a uk thluh a si. Zohman in a duhnak an el thei lo; A thiltuahmi khal thu an sut thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Ka thinlung a kim sal tikah cun ka hminthannak, ka maksaknak, ka sunlawinak le ka ram uknak pawl cu ka hnenah pek ṭheh an si sal. Ka kuthnuai ih bawi a rak si mi le ka minung phun-u pawl khal in in rak cohlangsal ih ka siangpahrang thuneihnak tla cu a hlan hnakih nasa sawn in ka hnenah pek a si sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Atu-ah cun keimah Nebuchadnezzar in vancung siangpahrang ka cawimawi, ka upat ih ka sunloih fawn a si. A tuahmi hmuahhmuah cu a ding le a dikmi an si ih puarthau zetih thil a tuahtu cu a ṭhum a si,” tiah siangpahrang in a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zan khatah siangpahrang Belshazzar in rawl ei-puai tumpi a tuah ih a kuthnuai um bawi le upa pawl thawngkhat a sawm ih hmun khatah zu an in tlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutiih zu an in laiah Belshazzar cun Jerusalem Biakinn ihsin a pa Nebuchadnezzar in sui khuathai le ngun khuathai le kheng pawl a rak lakmi kha rak keng dingin thu a pek. Amah le a bawi upa pawl, a nupi pawl le a nusun pawl in zu an innak ding hrangah a cahmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A cah vek cun hmakhatte-ah sui khuathai le kheng pawl cu an rak keng ih zu in-nak ah an hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuticun sui le ngun, dar le thir, zanthing le lungto tla ih tuahmi khawzing pawl cu an thangṭhat ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rinlopi ah milai kut pakhat a lang ih mei-inn vannak ṭhuam zawn phar parah cun ca a ngan. Ca a ngan rerotu kut cu siangpahrang in a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuvete in a mithmai a raam thluh; a ṭih ngaingai ih a khuk a ṭhia ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule mitkher thiam pawl, dawithiam pawl le arsi zohthiam pawl ko dingah mi a auh ciamco. An kawhmi pawl cu an rathleng ih an hnenah siangpahrang in, “Hi canganmi a siar theitu le a sullam i sim theitu cu siangpahrang puansen in thom a si pei, a hngawng ah hminṭhatnak sui ṭhirual a orh ding ih ka uknak sungah thuneihnak lamah pathumnak a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siangpahrang ruahnak petu pawl cu hmaiah an ra suak ih canganmi cu an zoh naón zohman in an siar thei lo; a tican tla siangpahrang a sim theitu zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siangpahrang Belshazzar cu a van a sang ih a hmai a raam sinsin; A bawi upa pawl khal in ziang tuah ding an thei hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siangpahrang le a bawi upa pawl mangbang ih an umnak thawmvang cu siangpahrang nu in a theih tikah rawl einak khaan sungah a ra lut ih, ‘Siangpahrang bawipa, na nunkhua sau hram seh! Hi bangtuk in thinhar le hmairaam cun um hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na ramsungah hin khawzing thianghlim pawl ih thlarau a neitu mi pakhat a um. Na pa siangpahrang a rak si laiah cupa cun ruahnak dik le theihnak a neihzia kha a langter zo ih a fimnak tla cu khawzing fimnak bangtuk a si. Curuangah na pa siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in kutṭial zohthiam pawl, mitkher thiam pawl, tinzoh thiam pawl le arsi zohthiam pawl ih hotu ah a tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thilti theinak a hleice in a nei; a fimzet ih mangih tican sim le mangbangza theih theinak le thuthuuk sim theinak lamah cun a thiam ngaingai. Curuangah cupa, siangpahrang in Belteshazzar ti ih hmin a sak mi, Daniel cu ko awla amah in a sullam a lo sim thluh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zamrangte in Daniel cu siangpahrang hmaiah cun an rak hruai ih siangpahrang in a hnenah, “Daniel na si maw? Judah mi salih kaihmi, ka pa siangpahrang in Judah ram ihsin a rak hruaimi Daniel na si maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khawzing thianghlim pawl ih thlarau na sungah a um ih thiamnak, theihnak le fimnak na nei tiah ka lo thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ruahnak i petu pawl le mitkher thiam pawl hi canganmi siartu dingah le a tican i simtu dingah an rak hruai naón a tican an thei thei hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A thup-awmi ih a tican a sim thei ih thil thuuk tla a sim thei tiah ka lo thei zo. Hi canganmi hi na siar thei ih a tican i sim thei ngaingai a si ahcun siangpahrang puansen in thom na si ding, hminṭhatnak suiṭhi na hngawng ah orh na si ding ih hi ramsung thuneihnak lamah pathumnak na si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah Daniel in, “Na laksawng cu na hrangah re ko aw, a si lole midang pe aw. Siangpahrang bawipa na hrangah hi canganmi cu ka siar ding ih a tican ka lo sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Cungnungbik Pathian in na pa Nebuchadnezzar cu siangpahrang tumzet ah a tuah ih huham a neihter ih mi nasa a siter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A nasa tuk ih phunkip, hnamkip le ṭongkip a ṭongmi in an ṭih ih an khur ciamco. Mi pakhatkhat thah a duh ahcun a that mai, nunter a duh ahcun a nunter mai. A duhduh in mi cu hminṭhatnak a pek ih mualpho khal in a tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sikhalsehla cutiih puarthau in, thinlungruh in le zaangfah thinpemnak zianghman nei lo ih a um ruangah cun a siangpahrang tokham cu lon a si ih upatnak dinhmun cu a sung a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Minung umnak khua le ram in dawihlo a si ih a thinlung cu ramsa thinlung vekah a cang. Hramlak laak lakah a um ih cawcang vekin hrampi a ei ih, humtu le phentu zianghman nei loin leenkolh ah a it ih dai in a tlak. Neta bikah Cungnungbik Pathian in minung ram uknak tlunah thu a nei ih cuih ram uknak cu a duhmi hnenah a pek thei a si, ti kha a run thei ngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Sikhalsehla cuih thu pawl cu nang a fapa hin na thei ṭheh naón na thinlung a neem cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vancung Bawipa dodal in hna na ṭuan ih Biakinn ihsin lakmi khuathai le kheng pawl hinah na keng ṭheh. Nangmah le na tlangsuak pawl, na nupi pawl le na nusun pawl in cuih khuathai thawn zu nan in ih sui le ngun, dar le thir, zanthing le lungto thawn tuahmi khawzing pawl nan thangṭhat ciamco. Khua a hmu thei lomi khuavang, zianghman thu a thei thei lo le zianghman theihnak a nei lomi khawzing cu nan cawimawi ciamco. Nan nunnak le nan thihnak tlunih laireltu, na tuahmi hmuahhmuah tlunih thuneitu Pathian sawn cu upatnak zianghman nan pe lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Curuangah hi thu pawl ngantu dingah kut a rak kuatnak cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“A nganmi cu, ‘Mene, mene, tekel u-pharsin,’ ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Atican cu a tanglam bangtuk in a si: ‘Mene,’ ti cu ‘siar’ tinak a si ih na ram uknak hi Pathian in a ni a siar zo ih a cemter cing ding, tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘Tekel,’ ti cu ‘cuai thlai’ tinak a si ih thlai na si tikah cuai na kim lo tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />‘u-pharsin,’ ti cu ‘ṭhen’ tinak a si ih na ram uknak hi ṭhenṭhek thluh a si ih Media mi le Persia mi hnenah pek a si, tinak a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hmakhatte-ah Belshazzar in Daniel kha siangpahrang puansen hruh dingah le a hngawng ih suiṭhi orh dingah a hnaṭuantu pawl thu a pek. Cutiin a uknak ih thuneitu bik pathumnak ah a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuih zan rori ah Babilon siangpahrang Belshazzar cu an that ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />kum sawmruk le kum hnih a timi Media mi Darias in Babilon ram cu a lak a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Darias in a ram pumpi uktu dingah ramṭhen uktu bawi za le kul a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuih bawi pawl zohtu le hotu ah bawi upa pathum a ret ih culak ah Daniel cu pakhat a si; ramṭhen uktu bawi za le kul cu an kutthuai ah an um. Annih in siangpahrang hrangih thil thupi le a ṭulmi pawl an ngaihtuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Reilote ah Daniel cu hotu a dang pahnih hnakin le ramṭhen uktu bawi dang pawl hnakin a hnaṭuan a ṭhat deuhnak kha a lang. Cutiin midang hnakih a lang deuh ruangah siangpahrang in a ram pumpi uktu dingah Daniel cu a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule hotu dang pahnih le ramṭhen uktu bawi pawl cun Daniel in sualnak le palhnak a nei maw ti an hawl ciamco; a sinan a sualnak an hmu lo, ziangahtile Daniel cu mifel rintlakzet a si ih thilsual le zumtlak lo thil zianghman a tuah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah anmah le anmah cu, “A biaknak thu ah dah tilo Daniel sual kan puh theinak ding zianghman kan hmu zik lo,” tiah an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah siangpahrang tong dingah an feh ih a hnenah, “Darias siangpahrang bawipa, na nunkhua sau hram seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na ram pumpi uktu bawi pawl, hotu pawl, ramṭhen uktu bawi pawl, ramṭhen uktu bawi bawmtu pawl le bawi dangdang kan zatein thinlung khatión thil pakhat kan lo dil. Thu pe awla na thupekmi vekih an thlun ṭhehnak dingah ngaihtuah aw. Ni sawmthum sungah zohman in siangpahrang bawipa nangmah hnen siarlo ziangvek khawzing le zovek milai hnen hmanah thlacammi le ngenmi nei hlah hai seh. Hi thupekmi a thlun lotu cu kiosa khumnak sungah hlon hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siangpahrang bawipa nangmah in hi thu hi suah awla na hmin khen aw. Cule mi hmuahhmuah ih thlun ṭheh dingin ngaihtuah aw; zohmanih thleng thei lomi Media mi le Persia mi pawl ih daan suahmi ah cang seh,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An tivek in Darias cun thu a pek ih a thupekmi parah a hmin a khen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siangpahrang in a hmin a khen zo, tikha Daniel in a theih tikah a inn ah a tlung. A inn tlunta khaan ahcun Jerusalem lam hoi in sangkate an um. Cutawkah a tuah ringring ṭheu vekin a ong awmi sangkate pakhat kiangah cun a khuk a bil ih ni khat ah voithum Pathian hnenah thla a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Daniel in Pathian hnen ah thla a cam ringring thotho ti kha a huatu pawl in an hmuh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Daniel sualpuh dingah an zatein siangpahrang hnenah an feh. Annih in, “Maw Siangpahrang bawipa, atu ihsin ni sawmthum sung siangpahrang bawipa nangmah hnen siarlo zohman in ziangvek khawzing le ziangvek milai hnen hmanah thlacammi le ngenmi nei hlah hai seh, tiah thu na pek zo,” tiah an ti. Siangpahrang bawipa in, “Asi, zohman ih el thei lomi thupek a si. Zohman ih thleng thei lomi Media le Persia mi pawl ih daan suahmi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah annih in siangpahrang hnenah, “Judah ram ihsin salkaihmi pakhat Daniel in siangpahrang bawipa nangmah a lo upat lo ih na thusuahmi khal a thlun lo. Nitinte ni khatah voithum thla a cam a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuih thu cu siangpahrang in a theih tikah a thin a nuam lo zet ih Daniel runsuak theinak dingah lamzin a phunphun a hawl. Sun nihlawh a hawl naón a hum theinak lamzin a hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Daniel a phiartu pawl cu siangpahrang hnenah an ra ih, “Siangpahrang bawipa, Media le Persia daan a si vekin siangpahrang ih a pek ciami thu cu thleng theih a si nawn lo, ti cu nangmah in na thei ko,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Siangpahrang in Daniel kai dingah thu a pek ih an kaih hnuah kiosa tampi khumnak sungah an thlak. Daniel hnenah cun siangpahrang in, “Rintlak zetih na renmi na Pathian in lo run hram seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zohman ih an run thei lonak dingah lungto tumpi pakhat thawn kiosa khumnak cu an khar ih siangpahrang hmin khennak tacik le a bawi upa pawl ih tacik in an khen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siangpahrang bawipa cu a inn ah a tlungkir ih cuih zan cu zanvar it lo, rawl khal ei lo le nomnak zianghman tuah loin a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zingthlapit ah a tho ih kiosa khur ahcun zamrangte in a va feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A va thlen tikah thinlung harzet in, “Maw Daniel, a nungmi Pathian riantu! Rintlak zetih na renmi na Pathian cun kiosa kaa sung ihsin a lo hum thei maw?” tiah a auh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule Daniel cun, “Maw Siangpahrang bawipa, na nunkhua sau hram seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian in kiosa pawl ih kaa huptu dingah a vancungmi a run thlah ih pakhat hman in in siatsuah lo. Sualnak zianghman ka nei lo ih siangpahrang bawipa na parah mawhnak zianghman ka neih lo ruangah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutikah siangpahrang cu a lung a awi tuk ih Daniel cu kiosa khur sung ihsin suah dingah thu a pek. An suah ih tuahmawhnak zianghman a ton lo kha an hmu; Pathian a rinsan ruangah a him a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule siangpahrang in Daniel sual a puhtu pawl cu an nupi le an faate pawl thawn kai tahrat in kiosa khumnak sungih thla dingah thu a pek. A thupekmi vekin an kai ih kiosa khumnak sungih an thlak tikah leilung hman an thlen hlanah kiosa cun an rak zon ih an ruh pawl tiangin an ṭamkiak ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutikah siangpahrang Darias cun mi phunkip, hnamkip le ṭongkip a ṭongtu leitlun mi hmuahhmuah hnenah ca a ngan: “Nan parah daihnak um hram seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka ramsung mi hmuahhmuah in Daniel ih Pathian cu upat ding le ṭih dingah thu ka pek zo. “Amah cu a nungmi Pathian, Kumkhua in a hmunmi Pathian a si. A uknak cu siatsuah a si dah lo ding ih a huham cu cem ni a nei dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Mi runtu le mi humtu a si. Lei le van khuazakip ah, Mangbangza le khawruahharza a tuah. Kiosa kaa sung ihsin Daniel a hum a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Daniel cu Darias uk sung le Persia mi siangpahrang Sairas uk sungah neinung zetin a nung a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Belshazzar in Babilon siangpahrang a ṭuan, kum khatnak ah keimah Daniel mang ka man ih zanah hmuhnak ka nei. Ka mang cu ka ngan ih cuih zanih ka hmuhmi cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />hi vekin a si: Khawzakip in thli a hrang ih tipithuanthum tidai tla a sem ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tipithuanthum sung cun sahrang tum zetzet pali an hung suak ih pakhat le pakhat an dang ciar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sahrang pakhatnak cu kiosa a bang, asinain muvanlai vekin thla a nei. Cutiih ka zoh laiah a thla cu a tlekcat. Cule sahrang cu an cawisaang ih milai bangin an dinter. Cuih hnuah milai thinlung an neihter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A pahnihnak sahrang cu savom a bang ih a dunglam ke in a ding. A ha in hnakruh pathum a keu ih a hnenah cun, “Na ei thei zat in ei rero ko aw,” tiah aw pakhat in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutiih ka zoh laiah sahrang dang pakhat a hung suak. Tlavang a bang naón a zaang parah thla pali a nei; a thla cu vate thla vek a si. Lu khal pali a nei. A hmuihmel zoh tikah thuneizet ding a bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cumi ka zoh rero laiah a palinak sahrang a hung suak. Huham neizet, ṭihnungza le tuksumza ramsa a si. Thir ha a nei ih an tum zetzet; cuih a thir ha thawn a dehmi pawl cu a ṭam ṭheh ih a palcih hai fawn a si. Sahrang dang vek si loin hi sahrang cun ki pahra a nei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutiih a ki pawl ka zoh rero laiah a ki lakah cun ki fate a hung suak ka hmu. Cuih ki fate cun a hmaisa ki pathum cu a thlong hai. Cuih ki fate cun milai mit a nei ih kaa khal a nei ih puarthau zetin a ṭong ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutiih ka zoh rero laiah cun siangpahrang tokham pawl an hun ret. Kumkhua ih a nungmi cu tokham pakhat parah a to. A hnipuan cu vur vekin a rang ih a sam cu tuuhmul vekin a thiangfai. A tokham cu meisa leng parah a um ih a hlio ciamco;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />meiling cu tidai luang bangin cutawk cun a suak ciamco. Amah riantu dingah minung a thawng a za in an um ih a hmaiah minung a thawngih thawngin an ding. Thuṭhennak cu an thok ih cabu pawl an kau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutiih ka zoh laiah ki fate in tluang a khawn rero le puarthau zetih a ṭong rero lai hrih ka thei. Cule ka hmuhhngan ah sahrang palinak an that ih a ruak cu meisa sungah an hlon ih cuticun a cemta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A dang sahrang pawl cu an huham neih mi hmuahhmuah laksak ṭheh an si, asinain an nunnak cu caan tawite sung zuah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zan ih langnak ka hmuhmi ahcun minung a bangmi pakhat ka hmu. Mero par in a ra ih kumkhua ih a nungmi hnenah cun a feh ih a hnenah a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule phunkip, hnamkip le ṭongkip ih ṭongtu pawl in amah an rian theinak dingah a hnenah cun thuneihnak, hminthannak, upatnak le siangpahrang huham hmuahhmuah pek a si. A thuneihnak cu kumkhua in a hmun ding ih a uknak a cem dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Langnak ka hmuhmi cun ka thin i phangter ih ka thinlung i buaiter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutawkih a dingmi pakhat hnenah ka hung feh ih a tican i simfiang dingah ka hung sut. A sullam cu hiti in i sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi sahrang tum zetzet pali cu leilung tlunih a suak dingmi uknak pali an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule Cungnungbik Pathian ih minung pawl in siangpahrang huham an ngah ding ih kumkhua in kumkhua tiang an cota ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule sahrang palinak, sahrang dang thawn a bang-aw lomi, ṭihnungza sahrang, a dar ke-tin le a thir ha thawn a dehmi hmuahhmuah a bohthlek ih a palcih rerotu ih thu theih ka duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A lu parih ki pahra a neihnak, neta ih ki pakhat a hung suahnak le a hung suah ruangih ki pathum an thlongnak thu tla cu theih ka duh. Mit a nei, kaa khal a nei ih puarthau zetin a ṭong ciamco. A dang hnakin ṭihnungza bik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutiih ka zoh laiah cuih ki cun Pathian ih minung pawl a do ih a neh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule kumkhua ih a nungmi a ra ih Cungnungbik Pathian ih minung pawl ṭan in thuṭhennak a tuah. Pathian minung pawl in siangpahrang thuneihnak an co caan a ra thleng zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuticun ka hnenah in simfiang a si: “Sahrang palinak cu leilung tlunih a hung suak dingmi uknak palinak a si ding ih uknak dang thawn a bang-aw lo ding. Leilung pumpi hi a neh ṭheh, a siatsuah ṭheh ding ih a palcih ciamco ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ki pahra cu cuih uknak a uktu ding siangpahrang pahra an si. Cule siangpahrang dang pakhat a suak ding; amah cu siangpahrang dang thawn an bang-aw lo ding ih siangpahrang pathum pawl kha a hlon ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cungnungbik Pathian a relsia ding ih Pathian minung pawl a hrem ding. An biaknak daan pawl le puai pawl thleng a tum ding; Pathian minung pawl cu kum thum le a hrek sung a kuthnuai ah a ret ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuih hnuah vancung thuṭhennak a rung um ding ih a huham le a thuneihnak hmuahhmuah cu laksak ṭheh a si ding; siatsuahnak a tong ding ih a hloralta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Leitlun uknak hmuahhmuah ih huham le maksaknak pawl cu Cungnungbik Pathian ih minung pawl hnenah pek a si ding. An comi siangpahrang huham cu a cem nawn lo ding ih leilungtlun mi uktu hmuahhmuah in an rian ding ih an upat ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Himi hi thunetnak a si. Ka ṭih tukih ka raam ṭheh; cuih thu cu ka thinlung sungah ka ret ringring.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Belshazzar in siangpahrang a ṭuan kum thumnak ah voihnihnak langnak ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuih langnak ka hmuhmi ahcun Elam peng lungdawl ih kulhmi Susa khawpi sungah um in ka thei aw. Ulai Tivapi kapah ka ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />cuih tivakap ahcun tuucang pakhat, ki saupi pahnih a neimi ka hmu; a ki pakhat cu a dang ki hnakin a sau ih a no deuh fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih tuucang in nitlak lam, saklam le thlanglam a khik rero kha ka zoh. Ramsa dang in an kham thei lo; a mi nehnak cun an luat thei fawn lo. A duhduh in ziang hmuahhmuah a tuah hluahhlo ih a hngalzet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cumi ih tican mangbangin ka ngaihtuah rero laiah nitlak lam ihsin mecang pakhat a ra tlan ciamco ka hmu; a tlan a cak tuk ih a ke in leilung a dai man lo. A mit le a mit karlakah a langzetmi ki pakhat a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tiva kapah a ding ka hmuhmi tuucang lamah cun a feh ih tuucang cu a tha neih patawp in a zon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuucang a zon le a sual lai cu ka zoh. A thin a heng tuk ih tuucang cu nasa zetin a a ki pahnih kiak ko in a khik. Tuucang cun khik ve theinak thazaang zianghman a nei lo. Leilung ah a ril ih mecang cun a palcih a si; a run theitu zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuih mecang cu a puarthau deuhdeuh ih a cah bik laitak ah a ki cu a kiak. Cuih ki pakhat ai ahcun a langzetmi ki pali an hung suak; a ki pali cun saklam, thlanglam, nisuah lam le nitlak lam an hoi fingfing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ki pali lakih pakhat sung ihsin ki fate pakhat a hung suak ih a huham cahnak cun thlang lam, nisuah lam le Ram Tiam lam a pan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Van ralkap, arsi pawl do ding tlak in a cak ih a do ih a hrekkhat cu leilungih a hlon hnuah a palcih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Van ralkap pawl hotu bawi hman a dodal; nitinte a hnenih an pekmi thawinak cu a kham ih Biakinn a tiborhhlawh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutawkah nitin thawinak pek ai-ah minung pawl in sualnak an tuah; biaknak dik cu leilungah hlonthlak a si. A tuahmi hmuahhmuah ah cuih ki cu a hlawhtling a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule vancungmi pakhat in a dang vancungmi hnenah, “Hi langnak sungih a langmi thil hi ziangtik tiangso a rei ding? Hi bangtuk tuksumza sualnak hin ziangtik tiangso nitin thawinak pekmi cu a ai-awh ding? Ziangtik tiangso van ralkap pawl le Biakinn cu palcih an si hrih ding?” ti ih a sut kha ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah cuih vancungmi cun, “Hi thil hi zanlam le zinglam thawnghnih le zathum sung a rei ding ih cuih sungah zinglam le zanlam thawinak pekmi zianghman a um lo ding. Cuih hnuah Biakinn cu a hlan vekin a um thei sal ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuih langnak ih tican ka ruah rero laiah rinlopi in mi pakhat ka hmaiah a ra ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ulai Tivapi tlun ihsin aw pakhat in a rak auh ih, “Gabriel, a hmuhmi ih tican cu a hnenah simfiang aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gabriel cu a ra ih ka kiangah a ra ding; ka ṭih tukih leilung ah ka bok. Ka hnenah cun, “Milaipa, hi thu hi theithiam aw. Na hmuhmi hi leilung cemnak thuthawn pehawknak a nei a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutiih a ṭong rero laiah ka tlu ih zianghman ka thei lo. Sikhalsehla anih cun i tho ih i dinter ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Pathian thinhengnak in ziangbangtuk thil a suahter ding tihi ka lo hmuh a si. Na hmuhmi langnak hi caan neta bik thawn pehtlaihnak a nei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Ki pahnih a neimi tuucang na hmuhmi kha Media le Persia uknak can-ai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mecang kha Grik uknak can-ai a si ih, a mit karlakih a langzetmi ki kha an siangpahrang hmaisa bik can-ai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ki pakhat a kiah hnu ih ki pali a hung suakmi kha an ram a ṭhen awk ṭheh hnu ih a hung suak dingmi uknak pali can-ai an si; hi uknak pali hi hmaisa uknak tluk cun an cak lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Cuih uknak pawl an cem zik cuahco thlang ih an siatvaat tuk ruangih hremnak an tuar tikcu a hung kim cuahco tikah mi lungruh, mi sualral le mi bumhmang siangpahrang pakhat a hung suak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A cak vivo ding, asinain a cahnak cu amah ih thilti theinak ruangah a si lo ding. Siatsuahnak nasa zetin a suahter ding ih a tuahmi hmuahhmuah ah a hlawhtling ding. Mi cak zetzet le Pathian ih minung pawl parah siatnak tampi a thlenter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi depde a si ruangah bumnak in thil a ti thei vivo ding. A zum aw ngaingai ding ih rinloparal ah mi tampi a tisiat ding. Siangpahrang lakih siangpahrang maksak bik hman a dodal ding; sikhalsehla amah cu milai cahnak tel lotein siatsuahnak a tong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na hnenih simfiang zo a si mi zinglam le zanlam raithawinak pekmi thu ih langnak na hmuhmi cu a ra kim ngaingai ding. Sikhalsehla thuthup ah ret aw, ziangahtile a kimnak dingah tikcu a rei hrih ding a si,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka thin a har ih ni tam nawn sung ka dam lo. Cuih hnuah ka tho ih siangpahrang ih fialmi hna cu ka ṭuan thei sal. Asinain ka hmuhmi cun ka mang i bangter ih ka theih thei mi a si lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahasueras ih fapa, Media mi Darias in Babilon ram cu a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siangpahrang a ṭuan kum khatnak ah cabu thianghlim pawl ka siar ih Bawipa in profet Jeremiah hnenih a rak sim cia bangtuk in Jerusalem cu kum sawmsarih sung siatsuah in a um ding timi thu cu ka ngaihtuah rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa Pathian hnenah thinlung taktein thla ka cam; rawl ul in, buri hnipuan hruk in vutcam lakah ka to ih ka dil rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuticun Bawipa ka Pathian hnenah thla ka cam ih ka minung pawl ih sualnak tla ka phuang. A hnenah, “ Bawipa Pathian, nang cu na maksakzet ih ka lo upat ngaingai. Na thukammi parah cun rintlakzet na si ih a lo duhtu le na thukham a thluntu parah cun a hmunmi duhdawtnak na nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kannih cu kan sual zo, mi sualral kan si ih mawhnak a tuahtu kan si. Kan tuah dingih na thupekmi cu kan hnong ih nangmah in thildik in hmuhmi ihsin kan pial zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na hmin in kan siangpahrang pawl, in uktu pawl, kan pupa pawl le kan miphun pumpi hnenah na profet pawl in thu an sim naón a lo riantu pawl ih thu cu kan ngai duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , nang cun a dikmi na tuah ringring naón kannih cun kan parah ningzahnak thil lawnglawng kan thlenter. Judea ram le Jerusalem khua, ramhla le ramnai hmunkip ih na ṭhekdarh mi Israel mi hmuahhmuah kan zatein kan mualpho ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan siangpahrang pawl, in uktu pawl le kan pupa pawl cu ningzak le fihnungza in an rak nung ih, maw Bawipa , na parah kan sual zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na parah raltho phun kan si nacingin in ngaithiam ih in zaangfah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw Bawipa kan Pathian, a lo riantu profet pawl hnen ihsin in pekmi na daan pawl bangtuk ih nung dingah in sim rero naón kan lo ngai duh cuanglo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel mi hmuahhmuah in na daan pawl cu kan bal ih na thu kan ngai lo. Cutiin na parih kan sual ruangah na siahhlawh Moses ih Daan sungih a ummi siatcamnak pawl cu kan parah na thlenter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kanmah le in uktu pawl parah ka thlenter ding na timi cu na thlenter ngaingai. Leitlun khua dangdang hnakin Jerusalem cu nasa deuh in na hrem;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Moses Daan sungih a ummi hremnak hmuahhmuah cu kan parah na thlenter ṭheh. Cuti si nacingin, maw Bawipa kan Pathian, kan sualsir in le thudik thlun tahratin na lungawiter kan tum hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa kan Pathian nang cun a dikmi na tuah ringring ruangah le na thu kan ngai duh lo ruangah kanmah hrem ding na tum ih na tumtah vekin in hrem taktak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Maw Bawipa kan Pathian, na cahnak le na huham na langter ih na minung pawl Izipt ram ihsin na suahter; na huham cu an ciing lai ringring. Kan sual zo, kan mawh tuk zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A liam ciami tikcu sungah nangmah cu in ṭantu na si ringring; curuangah Jerusalem parah na thinheng nawn hram hlah aw. Jerusalem cu na khawpi a si, na tlang thianghlim a si. Kanmah kan sual ruangah le kan pupa pawl in thilsual an rak tuah ruangah a kiangkap ramih mi hmuahhmuah in Jerusalem le na minung pawl cu an nautat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maw Pathian, ka thlacamnak le ka lo ngennak hi i theihsak hram aw. A siat ṭheh zomi na Biakinn cu a hlan vekin tungding sal aw; cuticun Pathian ngaingai na si ti an lo thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Maw Pathian, in run ngai hram aw. In run zoh awla harnak kan tonzia le na hmin a kengtu khawpi in harsatnak a tonzia hi run hmu hram aw. Thildik kan tuah ruangah si loin nang cu mi zaangfahtu na si ruangah na hnenah thla kan cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa , in run thei aw. Bawipa in ngaidam aw. Bawipa in run ngai awla in tuahsak hram aw! Mi hmuahhmuah in Pathian na sizia hi an theihnak dingah rei nawn hlah! Hi khawpi le hi minung pawl hi na ta an si ko,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka sualnak le Israel mi pawl sualnak phuangin thla ka cam ringring ih amah ih Biakinn thianghlim cu a hlan vekih a tundin salnak dingah Bawipa ka Pathian cat loin ka dil a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutiih thla ka cam laiah ka rak hmuh ciami Gabriel cu ka umnak hmunah cun a rung zam. Zanlam thawinak pek caan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gabriel cun ka hnenah, “Daniel, hi thu na theih theinak dingin nangmah bawm dingah ka ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian hnenih na dil tikah amah in a lo let ko. A lo duhdaw ih cuih thu sim dingah ka ra zo. Langnak na hmuhmi ih tican ka simfiang mi hi ṭhatein ngai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Sualnak le ṭhat lonak ihsin na minung pawl le na khawpi an luatnak dingah Pathian in kum sawmsarih ih let sarih a khiah zo. Sualnak cu ngaidam a si ding, dingnak cu kumkhua hrangin hngehter a si ding; cuticun sim ciami le na hmuhmi pawl cu an ra thleng ngaingai ding ih Biakinn thianghlim cu a thar in thianhlimter a si sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Himi hi ciing ṭha awla ruatfel aw: Jerusalem dinsal dingih thupek tikcu caan ihsin Pathian ih hrilmi hotu a rat hlanlo kum sarih let sarih a liam ding. Jerusalem cu lamzin tumpipi le ruhkulh hngetzetzet thawn dinsal a si ding ih kum sawmruk le kum hnih ih let sarih sung a ding ding; a sinan hih caan hi harsatnak le buainak caan a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuih caan a cem tikah Pathian ih hrilmi hotu cu dik lozetin an that ding. A cakzetmi ram uktu ih ralkap pawl in khawpi le Biakinn cu an siatsuah ṭheh ding. Tilik bangin a netnak a ra thleng ding; Pathian ih a timtuah ciami ral le siatsuahnak an ra thleng ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cuih ram uktu bawi cun kum sarih hrangin mi tampi thawn lungkimnak cakhen a tuah ding ih cuih tikcu ih hrek a cem tikah peknak le thawinak pawl cu a cemter ding. Thil Fihnung Tuksumza cu Biakinn sung hmunsangbik ah ret a si ding ih cutawkih a rettupa in Pathian ih tumtahsakmi netnak a ton hlanlo cutawk hmunsang bik ahcun a um ringring ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sairas in Persia siangpahrang a ṭuan kum thumnak ah Belteshazzar ti khalih kawhmi Daniel ih hnenah thu pakhat langter a si. Cuih thu cu thudik a si, asinain theih a har ngaingai. A hnenah langnak in simfiang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Culai ah zarh thum sung lungngai in ka rak um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zarh thum a kim hlan cu rawlthaw zianghman ka ei lo, sa khal ka ei lo; sabitti ka in lo ih ka sam khal ka hriat lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih kum thla khatnak thla, ni kul hluanli ni ah tiva tumzet ṭigris Tivapi kapah ka ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khua ka hun cuan ih minung bangtuk pakhat, puan hmangfeem hnipuan a hruk ih sui ṭha bik taikhap a khaptu ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A taksa ruangpi cu lungvar bangin a tleu. A mithmai cu nimthlakau vekin a vaang ih a mit tla cu meisa hlio vekin a hlio. A baan le a ke pawl cu hnawtfaimi dar vekin a tleu zukzo ih a aw cu miburpi au thawm bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih langnak a hmutu cu keimah lawng ka si. Ka kiangih a ummi pawl cun zianghman an hmu lo, asinain an ṭih ngaingai ih an tlan, cule an relh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keimah lawng ka taang ih cuih mangbangza langnak cu ka zoh rero. Ka tha a cem ṭheh, ka mithmai tla a dangzet ih zohman in in thei thiam zik lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A aw ka theih tikah leilungah ka tlu ih zianghman thei loin ka bokkhup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule kut pakhat in i kai ih ka kut le ka khuk in i vak ter. Ka khur rero lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vancungmi cun, “Daniel, Pathian ih duhdawtmi na si. Ding awla ka lo sim dingmi hi ṭhatein ngai aw. Na hnenih thlah mi ka si,” tiah i ti. Cutiih a sim vete in ka hung ding. Asinain ka khur rero thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule anih in, “Daniel, ṭih hlah. Theihthiamnak nei dingah tangdor dingih na ruahcat ni ihsin na thlacam Pathian in a thei. Na thlacamnak lo let dingah ka ra zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Persia ram kilvengtu bawi vancungmi in ni kul hluankhat sung i kham. Cule vancungmi lakih a tum bik pakhat Mikhael in i ra bawm, ziangahtile Persia ramah cun keimah lawng taantami ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmailam ah na minung pawl parah ziang a thleng ding ti lo theihter dingah ka ra zo a si. Hi langnak cu hmailam thu a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutiih a ṭong tikah cun leilung lawng ka zoh, zianghman ṭong thei loin ka um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule minung vek a si mi vancungmi cun a kut a run dawh ih ka hmur i tham. A hnenah cun, “Bawipa, hi langnak hin ka tha i cemter ṭheh ih khur loin ka um thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A bawipa hmaiih a dingtu sal vek ka si. Na hnenah ziangtinso ka ṭong thei ding? Thazaang zianghman ka nei lo, thaw thawt ding khal ka nei lo,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I run tham sal ih cak deuh in ka thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anih cun ka hnenah, “Pathian in a lo duhdaw a si. Curuangah zianghman phang hlah, zianghman in lo ṭihter hlah seh,” a ti. Cutiih i ti tikah cun ka cak deuhdeuh in ka thei aw ih a hnenah, “Bawipa, i sim dingmi cu i sim aw. I cakter deuh zo,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anih in, “Ziangruangah na hnenah ka ra, ti hi na thei maw? Thutak Cabu sungih an nganmi na hnenih phuang dingah ka ra. Atu-ah Persia ram kilvengtu bawi vancungmi do dingah ka kirsal ding. Cuih hnuah Grik ram kilvengtu bawi vancungmi a lang ding. Israel ram kilvengtu bawi vancungmi Mikhael siarlo i bawmtu zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amah Michael cu i bawmtu le i ṭantu dingah ṭuanvo neitu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule atuih ka lo sim dingmi hi thudik a si,” a ti. Vancungmi cun, “Persia ram cu siangpahrang pathum in an uk hrih ding. A palinak siangpahrang cu a dang pawl hnakin a lian deuh ding. A cah bik le a lian bik laitak ahcun Grik ram a zuam ngam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Cule a ralṭha zetmi siangpahrang pakhat a hung suak ding. A uk mi ram cu a kau ngaingai ding ih a duhmi poh a tuah hluahhlo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain a cah bik laitak ah a ram ukmi cu a ṭhen-aw thluh ding ih ram pali ah a cang ding. Amah ih tesinfa a si lomi in a ai-ah siangpahrang an ṭuan ding, sikhalsehla amah tluk cun zohman in huham an nei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Izipt ram siangpahrang cu a cakzet ding. A ralbawi tumbik pakhat cu amah hnakin a caksawn ding ih a ram ukmi tla a kausawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kum tampi hnuah Izipt siangpahrang in Siria siangpahrang thawn ṭantlangnak cakhen an tuah ding ih a fanu tla a nupi dingah a pe ding. Sikhalsehla cuih cakhen cun rei a awh lo ding. Izipt siangpahrang ih fanu, a pasal, a fa le amah a thluntu, siahhlawh pawl thah ṭheh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Reilote ah Izipt siangpahrang fanu ih sungkhat siangpahrang a cang ding. Siria siangpahrang ralkap pawl a do ding; an ral ṭannak ruhkulh sung tiangin a nor ding ih a neh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An khawzing lem pawl le an khuavang pawl hnenih pekmi sui le ngun ih tuahmi thilri pawl cu Siria ihsin Izipt ah a phurkir ding. Kum rei nawn daihnak a um hnuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siria siangpahrang in Izipt ram a do ding; asinain a siip sal a ṭul ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Siria siangpahrang fapa pawl in raldo dingah an tim an tuah ding ih ralkap tam ngaingai an khawm ding. Siangpahrang fapa lakih pakhat in ral pawl ih ṭanhmun an khuarnak cu tilian bangin a do ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah a thinhengin Izipt siangpahrang in Siria siangpahrang cu a do ding ih a ralkap tam ngaingai a kai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutiih ral a neh ruangah le Siria ralkap tampi a thah ruangah cun a hngalzet ding; asinain ral cu a neh ringring lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Siria siangpahrang khal a kirsal ding ih a hlan hnakih ralkap tamdeuh in a khawm ding. A tikcu a remcan tikah hriamnam ṭhazet kengtu a ralkap siarcawk lo thawn Izipt do dingah a pan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Izipt mi tampi cu an siangpahrang duh lo ah ral an tho ding. Cule Daniel, na miphun sungin mithah ṭih lo mi hrekkhat cu, langnak an hmuh ruangah ral an tho ve ding; sikhalsehla an sung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Curuangah Siria siangpahrang cun ralhruang ih kulhmi khawpi cu a kulh ding ih a la ding. Izipt ralkap pawl cun an do thei nawn lo ding; an ralkap lakih a cakbik pawl hman raldo dingah thazaang an nei nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ral nehtu Siria cun dotu zohman nei loin a duhduh a tuah vivo ding. Ram Tiam ah a ding ding ih cuih ram cu a kut sungah a hum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Cule Siria siangpahrang cun raldo dingah a ngaihtuah ding; a ralkap hmuahhmuah hman a tum ding. A ral ram siatsuah ṭheh dingah a ral thawn ṭantlangnak cakhen a tuah ding ih a fanu tla a nupi dingah a pe ding. Asinain a tumtahmi cu a tisuak lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuih hnuah tifinriat kap ram pawl a do ding ih ram tampi a neh ding. Sikhalsehla ramdang pakhat uktu bawi in amah cu a neh ding ih a puarthaunak cu a cemter ding; a puarthaunak cu amah Siria siangpahrang par lala ah a thlenter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Siangpahrang cu amah ih ram ralṭannak ralhruang ah kir tahratin a ṭang ding naón a sung thotho ding; cuticun anih khal a cem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Amah ih hnuah siangpahrang dang pakhat a suak ding. Cuih siangpahrang cun a ramsung paisa ṭhanter duh ah a kuthnuai bawi pakhat a fial ding ih a ram minung pawl hnen ihsin ngunkhuai tampi in a la ding. Reilote ah cuih siangpahrang cu an that ding, sikhalsehla mizapi hmuh ah a si lo ding ih raldonak hmun khalah a si lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Vancungmi in a simfiang vivo ih, “Cuih siangpahrang a hun sangtu Siria siangpahrang cu mi ṭha lo, mi siakha zet a si ding; siangpahrang can theinak lamzin khal a nei lo ding naón rinlopi ah mibumnak in siangpahrang thuneihnak cu a long ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amah a dodaltu cu, Pathian ih Puithiam Sang a si khalle, hlonhlo le hnonhlo a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cakhen tuah tahrat in ram tampi a bum ding; ram fate uktu asinain ni khat hnu ni khat a cak deuhdeuh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rinlopi ah a lianzetmi peng a do ding ih a pupa pawl ih tuah dah lomi thil a tuah ciamco ding. Raldonak ih a lakmi le a lonmi hransaw thilri pawl cu amah a thluntu pawl a zem ciamco ding. Ralhruang tampi do dingah a tum lawk ding naón a rei hlanah a tikcu a cem ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ralṭha zetin Izipt ram do dingah ralkap tampi a la ding; Izipt siangpahrang khal amah do dingah ralkap tamzet le cakzet thawn a tiar-aw ve ding. Asinain Izipt siangpahrang cu phiarnak a tong ding ih a hlawhtling lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A thuron bikmi pawl in an siatsuah ding; a ralkap tampi thah an si ding ih an ṭekdarh ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule siangpahrang pahnih cu cabuai pakhat ah rawl an hil tlang ding; sikhalsehla an thinlung cu a ṭha lo veve ding ih pakhat le pakhat an bum aw ton rero ding. An tumtahmi cu an tisuak lo ding, ziangahtile a tikcu a kim hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Siria siangpahrang cu a lonmi thilri hmuahhmuah thawn a tlungkir ding; Pathian minung pawl ih biaknak siatsuah ṭheh tum in a tlungkir ding. A duhduh a tuah vivo ding ih amah ih ramah a kir ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Nehhnu ah Izipt ram a do sal ding; sikhalsehla a hlan vekin thil a cang thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Rom miphun pawl amah do dingah lawng thawn an ra ding ih a thin a phang ding. “Cule a thinheng in a kir ding ih Pathian minung pawl ih biaknak siatsuah a tum ciamco ding. Mah ih biaknak a tlansantu pawl ih ruahnak pekmi kha a thlun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A ralkap hrekkhat pawl cun Biakinn an borhhlawhter ding. Nitin thawinak pekmi cu an cemter ding ih thil Fihnung Tuksumza an ret ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cuih siangpahrang cun hrawhhrawlnak thawn hna a ṭuan ding ruangah an biaknak a dungtuntu pawl cun an bawm ding; sikhalsehla Pathian a thluntu pawl cun an do ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mipi lakih hotu fim pawl in an fimnak kha mi tampi hnenah an hlawm ve ding. Asinain a rei hlanah cupawl ṭhenkhat cu raldonak ah an thi ding ih ṭhenkhat meisa tla in an ur that ding. Cule mi ṭhenkhat cu an thilri lonsak an si ding ih thawng ih thlak an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cutiih thahnak an tuar rero laiah Pathian minung pawl cu bomnak malte an ngah ding; anmah ṭantu mitampi cu mahih zawnruahnak ruangih ṭantu an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cuih hotu fim hrekkhat pawl cu thahnak an tuar ding naón cutiih tuarnak ruangah misenpi pawl cu an thiangfai deuh ding. Cuticun caan netnak, Pathian ih a khiahmi caan, a thlen hlan cu a si vivo hrih ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Siria siangpahrang cun a duhduh a tuah ding. Ziangvek khawzing hnakin ka tum sawn, tiah tluang a khawng ding ih Cungnungbik Pathian hnak hmanin ka maksak sawn, tiah a porh-aw ding. Pathian hremnak a ton hlan cu cutiin a ti thei vivo ko ding. Asinain Pathian cun a tumtah vek cekci in a tuah suak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Siangpahrang cun a pupa pawl ih an rak renmi khawzing, le nunau pawl ih an duhzetmi khawzing khal zianghman ah a siar lo ding. Ziangbangtuk khawzing hman a poisa lo ding, ziangahtile khawzing hnakin ka tum sawn, tiah a ruat-aw ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cuhnakin ralhruang a humhimtu khawzing a upat sawn ding. A pupa pawl ih an biak dah lomi khawzing hnen sawnah sui le ngun, lungmankhung le laksawng sunglawi dangdang a pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A ralhruang pawl ihsin ṭangtu dingah ramdang khawzing biatu pawl a hmang ding. Amah kha in uktu bawi na si, ti ih a saangtu pawl cu upatnak, hminṭhatnak, hnaṭuan tumpipi le laksawngah leiram a pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Siria siangpahrang ih netnak tikcu a kim cuahco thlang tikah Izipt siangpahrang in amah kha a do ding; cule Izipt siangpahrang cu a cahnak zate, a rang le a rangleng pawl le lawng tampi thawn a do ve ding. Tilian bangin ram tampi a do ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ram Tiam hman a do ding ih a thawng a thawngin a that ding; sikhalsehla Edom ram, Moab ram le Ammon ram a taang hrihmi pawl cu an luat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hi ram pawl a do tikah cun Izipt ram hman a luat lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Izipt ramih an thuhmi hlawnthil, sui, ngun le a dang thil mankhung pawl a la ṭheh ding. Libia ram le Ethiopia ram tla a neh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Cule nisuah lam le sak lam ihsin a thlengmi thuthang in a thin a phangter ding; thinṭeu zetin a do sinsin ding ih khua-le-ram tampi a siatsuah ding ih mi tam ngaingai a that ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A siangpahrang puanthlam pawl hman cu tifinriat le Biakinn dinnak tlang karlakah a sak ding. Sihmansehla cutawkah zohman bawmtu nei loin a thi ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Puan hmangfeem ih tuahmi hnipuan a hruktu vancungmi in, “Cuih caan ah na minung pawl a kilvengtu vancungmi maksak Mikhael a lang ding. Hi miphun pawl hnenah an thawhkeh ihsin an ton dah lomi harsatnak nasazet a thleng ding. Cuih tikcu a kim tikah Pathian cabu sungih hmin nganmi na miphun pawl cu runsuak an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thi zomi minung tampi an nungsal ding; mi ṭhenkhat cu kumkhua nunnak an co ding ih ṭhenkhat cu kumkhua ningzahnak an tuar ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hotu fim pawl cu van ih tleunak hmuahhmuah thawn an tleu ding. A dikmi tuah dingah mitampi a zirhtu pawl cu arsi bangin kumkhua in an tleu ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule ka hnenah, “Daniel, atu-ah cabu cu khup awla leilung a cem hlanlo cu zohman ih on lo dingin a parah tacik khen aw. Minung tampi in thil a cangmi pawl ih tican theih an tum rero ding naón an zuamnak cu alak a si ṭheh ding,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuih hnuah tivakap ah mi pahnih an din ka hmu; kap khatah pakhat fingfing an ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuih mi pakhat in tiva tlunlam ih a dingtu vancungmi hnenah, “Hi vek khawruahhar thil pawl a cem hlanah tikcu ziangtlukso a um hrih ding?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vancungmi cun a kut pahnih van lamah thlir in Kumkhua Pathian hmin saal in thukamnak a tuah ih, “Kum thum le a hrek a um ding. Pathian minung pawl hremnak a cem tikah hi thil hmuahhmuah cu a kim ṭheh ding a si,” a timi ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutiih a timi cu ka thei naón a tican ka thei thei lo. Curuangah, “Bawipa, ziangvekin so a cemnetnak a si ding?” tiah ka sut sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah anih in, “Daniel, atu-ah feh aw, ziangahtile hi thu pawl cu tikcu netnak a thlen hlanlo zohman ih theih lo dingin thuh ih tacik khenmi a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tampi cu thianternak an ngah ding. Mi ṭhalo pawl cun an thei thei lo ding ih an ṭha lo vivo ko ding; asinain mifim pawl cun an thei thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Nitin raithawinak an baansan, cumicu Fihnung Tuksumza an tuah thok ihsin, ni thawngkhat le zahnih le sawmkua a liam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni thawngkhat zathum sawmthum le ni nga a cem hlanlo rintlak zetih a nungtu pawl cu milungawi an si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Cule nang Daniel, a net tiang rintlak zetin um aw. Leitlun na nunnak cu a cem ding, asinain tikcu netnak ahcun laksawng co dingin na thosal ding,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
</usx>
